<title>USA: Ark Restaurants Q2 March 29 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Ark Restaurants Q2 March 29 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>13 Weeks Ended    26 Weeks Ended</p>
<p>				    Mar 29  Mar 30,  Mar 29,  Mar 30,</p>
<p>				     1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
<p>				    (000's omitted except share data)</p>
<p> Total sales		   $27,749  $17,699  $49,187  $39,116</p>
<p>Loss before benefit for</p>
<p> income taxes	    (1,847)    (2,053)  (2,768)    (2,008)</p>
<p> Benefit for income taxes    (739)  (1,024)  (1,107)  (1,004)</p>
<p> Net loss			(1,108)  (1,029)  (1,661)  (1,004)</p>
<p> Net loss per share	    (.29)    (.32)    (.46)    (.31)</p>
<p>Weighted number of shares</p>
<p>    outstanding		  3,829    3,245    3,600    3,220</p>
<p>NOTE:  Loss before the benefit for income taxes for the first six months of 1997 includes pre-opening and early operating losses of approximately $2,000,000 in connection with the Las Vegas operations.</p>
<p>Loss before the benefit for income taxes for the second quarter of 1997 includes pre-opening and early operating losses of approximately $700,000 in connection with the Las Vegas operations.</p>
